  "goodToKnow": "Die Auswanderung is emigration: die Auswanderung nach Amerika. In the 19th century, over five million Germans emigrated to the USA, many via Bremerhaven and Hamburg; the Deutsches Auswandererhaus in Bremerhaven tells their stories. Today about 40 million Americans claim German ancestry. Auswandern means to emigrate, and der Auswanderer is an emigrant; TV shows like Goodbye Deutschland follow them. Plural: die Auswanderungen."
